{"pages":[{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["BIBLICAL",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,313.74000000000001,116.00059999999996,80,false],["INTERPRETATION",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,456.30000000000007,176.00059999999996,80,false],["TOM HUDZINA",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,289.18000000000001,194.10059999999999,20,false],["When one is studying a passage of Scripture, a basic",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,342.42000000000007,237.8368999999999,9,false],["but helpful pattern to follow is the threefold process of",146.40000000000001,238.43489999999986,352.18500000000006,250.8368999999999,9,false],["observation, interpretation, and application.",146.40000000000001,251.43489999999986,314.56500000000005,263.8368999999999,9,false],["I can never remember the “how,” because it",370.20000000000005,225.43489999999986,533.67600000000016,237.8368999999999,9,false],["rebelliously begins with an h instead of a w. Maybe",370.20000000000005,238.43489999999986,561.25200000000007,250.8368999999999,9,false],["it’s the same for you. If so, that’s okay. This is just a",370.20000000000005,251.43489999999986,560.31600000000014,263.8368999999999,9,false],["general template; it’s not meant to be a science or",370.20000000000005,264.43489999999986,555.58200000000011,276.8368999999999,9,false],["a straitjacket. Once you get a feel for some of these",370.20000000000005,277.43489999999997,560.19000000000028,289.83689999999996,9,false],["questions, try to keep an eye out for key words or",370.20000000000005,290.43489999999997,553.59300000000007,302.83689999999996,9,false],["phrases, repeated words, contrasts and comparisons,",370.20000000000005,303.43489999999997,570.09900000000016,315.83689999999996,9,false],["and terms of summary and conclusions (“so that,” “for",370.20000000000005,316.43489999999997,574.62600000000009,328.83689999999996,9,false],["this reason,” and so on).",370.20000000000005,329.43489999999997,459.87600000000003,341.83689999999996,9,false],["OBSERVATION",146.40000000000001,283.81989999999996,206.86000000000001,304.35989999999998,20,false],["This is pretty straightforward: observe what the",146.40000000000001,303.43489999999997,327.48900000000003,315.83689999999996,9,false],["passage is saying and describing.",146.40000000000001,316.43489999999997,270.27600000000001,328.83689999999996,9,false],["First, read through a portion of Scripture and then",146.40000000000001,329.43489999999997,336.63300000000004,341.83689999999996,9,false],["go back and make some initial observations about it:",146.40000000000001,342.43489999999997,343.55400000000009,354.83689999999996,9,false],["Who are the characters? What’s going on? Where is",146.40000000000001,355.43489999999997,340.49400000000003,367.83689999999996,9,false],["this taking place? Revisit the part of your brain that",146.40000000000001,368.43489999999997,340.56600000000014,380.83689999999996,9,false],["houses all of that literary criticism stuff your English",146.40000000000001,381.43489999999997,346.43400000000003,393.83689999999996,9,false],["teacher went on and on about while you doodled",146.40000000000001,394.43489999999997,328.55100000000004,406.83689999999996,9,false],["with your new four-color ballpoint pen. As a quick",146.40000000000001,407.43489999999997,335.95800000000003,419.83689999999996,9,false],["refresher, remember to ask yourself some basic who-",146.40000000000001,420.43489999999997,346.28100000000006,432.83689999999996,9,false],["what-when-where observational questions:",146.40000000000001,433.43489999999997,311.98200000000008,445.83689999999996,9,false],["INTERPRETATION",370.20000000000005,361.81989999999996,443.70000000000005,382.35989999999998,20,false],["Often observation slides right into interpretation.",370.20000000000005,381.43489999999997,558.3180000000001,393.83689999999996,9,false],["But strictly speaking, observation refers to trying to",370.20000000000005,394.43489999999997,565.58100000000013,406.83689999999996,9,false],["understand what’s being said, while interpretation",370.20000000000005,407.43489999999997,561.51300000000015,419.83689999999996,9,false],["refers to understanding the overall meaning.",370.20000000000005,420.43489999999997,538.43700000000013,432.83689999999996,9,false],["WHO is speaking? Who is this about? Who are",164.40000000000001,459.43489999999997,340.59300000000007,471.83689999999996,9,false],["the main characters?",164.40000000000001,472.43489999999997,244.21199999999999,484.83689999999996,9,false],["B I B L I C A L I N T E R P R E TAT I O N 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,624.74980000000005,9,false],["WHAT is the subject or event covered in the",164.40000000000001,498.43490000000003,331.17000000000007,510.83690000000001,9,false],["chapter? What do you learn about the people,",164.40000000000001,511.43490000000003,335.17500000000007,523.83690000000001,9,false],["event, or teaching?",164.40000000000001,524.43489999999997,236.274,536.83690000000001,9,false],["WHEN do\/will the events occur or did\/will",164.40000000000001,550.43489999999997,328.245,562.83690000000001,9,false],["something happen to someone?",164.40000000000001,563.43489999999997,283.86600000000004,575.83690000000001,9,false],["From what you’ve learned in your observation",370.20000000000005,446.43489999999997,544.08000000000015,458.83689999999996,9,false],["of the text, you are trying to discern a primary",370.20000000000005,459.43489999999997,542.73900000000015,471.83689999999996,9,false],["meaning of the passage—what the biblical author",370.20000000000005,472.43489999999997,555.92400000000021,484.83689999999996,9,false],["was seeking to communicate and what God was",370.20000000000005,485.43490000000003,550.0920000000001,497.83690000000001,9,false],["seeking to communicate through that biblical author.",370.20000000000005,498.43490000000003,571.15200000000016,510.83690000000001,9,false],["A particularly fruitful way to pull these things out",370.20000000000005,511.43490000000003,557.80500000000018,523.83690000000001,9,false],["of the passage is to ask questions such as “What",370.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,550.47000000000025,536.83690000000001,9,false],["sinful, broken, or fallen condition is being addressed",370.20000000000005,537.43489999999997,567.84900000000016,549.83690000000001,9,false],["or corrected by the passage?” “What is the deeper",370.20000000000005,550.43489999999997,557.07600000000014,562.83690000000001,9,false],["sin beneath the behavior?” and “What prompted",370.20000000000005,563.43489999999997,553.09800000000007,575.83690000000001,9,false],["the author to write this passage?” Keeping these",370.20000000000005,576.43489999999997,551.9190000000001,588.83690000000001,9,false],["questions in mind can help you uncover the primary",370.20000000000005,589.43489999999997,567.23700000000019,601.83690000000001,9,false],["meaning of the text.",370.20000000000005,602.43489999999997,445.22400000000005,614.83690000000001,9,false],["WHERE did or will this happen? Where was it",164.40000000000001,589.43489999999997,339.87300000000005,601.83690000000001,9,false],["said?",164.40000000000001,602.43489999999997,184.00200000000001,614.83690000000001,9,false],["WHY is something being said or mentioned?",164.40000000000001,628.43489999999997,333.12300000000005,640.83690000000001,9,false],["Why would\/will this happen? Why at that time",164.40000000000001,641.43489999999997,341.7000000000001,653.83690000000001,9,false],["and\/or to this person\/people?",164.40000000000001,654.43489999999997,276.71100000000001,666.83690000000001,9,false],["APPLICATION",370.20000000000005,634.81989999999996,426.88,655.35989999999993,20,false],["So, how does the passage apply to you and to others?",370.20000000000005,654.43489999999997,566.88600000000019,666.83690000000001,9,false],["And what are some actions you need to take in order",370.20000000000005,667.43489999999997,567.28200000000015,679.83690000000001,9,false],["to apply God’s Word directly to your life?",370.20000000000005,680.43489999999997,523.96500000000015,692.83690000000001,9,false],["HOW will it happen? How is it to be done? How is",164.40000000000001,680.43489999999997,351.48300000000006,692.83690000000001,9,false],["it illustrated?",164.40000000000001,693.43489999999997,215.601,705.83690000000001,9,false],["Let me suggest something here. I think our reflections",370.20000000000005,706.43489999999997,574.34700000000021,718.83690000000001,9,false]]},{"segs":[["tend to skip along the surface level of behavior or",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,331.13400000000013,45.836899999999901,9,false],["habits that need changing. This is okay, but often a",146.40000000000001,46.434899999999857,336.47100000000012,58.836899999999901,9,false],["more significant application resides at the level of",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,334.50000000000006,71.836899999999901,9,false],["our relating to God—our experiencing his grace or",146.40000000000001,72.434899999999857,334.8780000000001,84.836899999999901,9,false],["trusting in his character or promises. In light of this, I",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,348.60300000000018,97.836899999999901,9,false],["like to pray through certain questions that help me to",146.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,346.94700000000012,110.8368999999999,9,false],["apply what I’ve been reading to my walk with God.",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,335.60700000000008,123.8368999999999,9,false],["God, what are you trying to say to me through this",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,333.87000000000012,136.8368999999999,9,false],["passage?",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,179.82600000000002,149.8368999999999,9,false],["In what ways am I looking to find life in things",164.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,338.46000000000015,175.8368999999999,9,false],["besides you, Lord?",164.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,234.36599999999999,188.8368999999999,9,false],["In what ways am I seeking to earn your favor",164.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,332.79000000000008,214.8368999999999,9,false],["rather than live by grace?",164.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,259.63800000000003,227.8368999999999,9,false],["What do my actions suggest that I’m wrongly",164.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,334.5,253.8368999999999,9,false],["believing about your character, our relationship,",164.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,346.68600000000004,266.8368999999999,9,false],["and what you’ve said in your Word?",164.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,298.09500000000003,279.8368999999999,9,false],["In what ways do we need to be more intimate in",164.40000000000001,293.43489999999997,343.79700000000014,305.83689999999996,9,false],["our relationship?",164.40000000000001,306.43489999999997,229.596,318.83689999999996,9,false],["In what way is Jesus the answer to my problem?",164.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,346.209,344.83689999999996,9,false],["I particularly like thinking about the last one: In what",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,348.4860000000001,370.83689999999996,9,false],["way does Jesus provide an answer or solution to my",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,341.49300000000011,383.83689999999996,9,false],["sin problem? It’s hard to get into too much theological",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,349.3950000000001,396.83689999999996,9,false],["trouble with a question like this.",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,268.35900000000004,409.83689999999996,9,false],["Appended to the end of this article is a helpful",146.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,319.71300000000002,435.83689999999996,9,false],["cheat-sheet to keep in your Bible to remember the",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,335.22900000000004,448.83689999999996,9,false],["interpretive process.",146.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,225.16800000000001,461.83689999999996,9,false],["B I B L I C A L",43.841199999999994,592.20079999999996,57.071200000000005,625.54179999999997,7,false],["I N T E R P R E TAT I O N 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,589.22579999999994,9,false],["Excerpt takem from “Four Sevens”",146.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,274.89300000000003,552.84590000000003,9,false]],"w":612,"h":792,"ocr":false},{"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["Bible Study Methods an invitation to discovery",15.178534199999973,37.903530499999874,296.54564400000015,78.591750000000047,28.965500000000002,false],["Survey",71.720700000000008,107.04049149999992,121.66866450000001,125.19932499999993,14.896500000000001,false],["the Big Picture",71.720700000000008,121.7574085,137.8758345,132.85457499999995,9.1035000000000004,false],["Survey the big picture by",71.720700000000008,137.45003850000001,163.63873950000004,148.72927500000003,9.1035000000000004,false],["analyzing the . . .",71.720700000000008,148.37423849999993,132.68683950000002,159.65347499999996,9.1035000000000004,false],["• Historical Context",75.395199600000012,164.08923489999995,140.96515530000002,174.343075,8.2759,false],["• Literary Context",75.858650000000011,178.98585489999994,135.4285782,189.23969499999998,8.2759,false],["• Redemptive Context",75.858650000000011,193.88247489999992,148.88519160000004,204.13631499999997,8.2759,false],["explore",193.22070000000002,106.98679149999987,249.11236800000003,125.14562499999988,14.896500000000001,false],["the PaSSage",193.22070000000002,121.70370850000006,246.98597100000001,132.80087500000002,9.1035000000000004,false],["Carefully explore the biblical",193.26840000000001,137.45003850000001,295.75560300000001,148.72927500000003,9.1035000000000004,false],["text by applying the interpretive",193.26840000000001,148.37423849999993,307.83594750000003,159.65347499999996,9.1035000000000004,false],["approach that best fits the genre",193.26840000000001,159.2983385,310.84010250000006,170.57757500000002,9.1035000000000004,false],["of the passage.",193.26840000000001,170.22243849999995,248.12609100000003,181.50167499999998,9.1035000000000004,false],["(Different genres require different",193.0049544,185.2034701,285.69547670000009,194.16377499999999,7.4483000000000006,false],["interpretive steps.)",193.26840000000001,194.14137010000002,245.49654730000003,203.101675,7.4483000000000006,false],["DIScover",346.22070000000002,106.98679149999987,408.60724199999999,125.14562499999988,14.896500000000001,false],["the Big IDea",346.22070000000002,121.70370850000006,397.65547500000002,132.80087500000002,9.1035000000000004,false],["Summarize the",346.58670000000001,137.45003850000001,401.27142450000002,148.72927500000003,9.1035000000000004,false],["results of your",346.58670000000001,148.37423849999993,399.64189799999997,159.65347499999996,9.1035000000000004,false],["interpretive journey.",346.58670000000001,159.2983385,421.31733150000002,170.57757500000002,9.1035000000000004,false],["steps to survey",71.720700000000008,226.0183085000001,142.40937750000001,237.11547500000006,9.1035000000000004,false],["• \u0007 Consult commentaries to",71.720700000000008,240.09181869999986,149.35893750000002,249.54992499999992,7.8621000000000008,false],["establish the author, audience",78.151600000000002,249.52631869999993,164.01359410000009,258.98442499999999,7.8621000000000008,false],["and date",78.151600000000002,258.96081869999989,103.1609401,268.41892499999994,7.8621000000000008,false],["• Create a book summary",71.720700000000008,272.56641869999999,145.58512949999999,282.02452499999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Consider how your passage",71.720700000000008,286.17571379999998,157.51979730000002,295.63382009999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["fits into God’s plan to create",78.151600000000002,295.60641870000001,159.57150760000002,305.064525,7.8621000000000008,false],["a community of redeemed",78.151600000000002,305.04081869999999,153.34472440000002,314.49892499999999,7.8621000000000008,false],["people for his glory through",78.151600000000002,314.4753187,157.58239630000008,323.933425,7.8621000000000008,false],["Jesus Christ",78.151600000000002,323.90981870000002,113.72760249999999,333.36792500000001,7.8621000000000008,false],["StepS to Explore",193.26840000000001,225.8860085,267.74413350000003,236.98317499999996,9.1035000000000004,false],["The following steps are helpful when",193.26840000000001,236.36618309999994,309.52527270000007,246.10732499999995,7.8621000000000008,false],["studying an epistle:",193.26840000000001,245.80058309999993,254.75788410000004,255.54172499999993,7.8621000000000008,false],["• Create a structural layout",193.26840000000001,259.68921869999986,272.65988580000004,269.14732499999991,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Read your passage several times making",193.26840000000001,273.29851379999991,315.81495270000005,282.75662009999996,7.8621000000000008,false],["careful observations",199.6994,282.72921869999999,258.16983770000002,292.18732499999999,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Ask questions for understanding",193.26820219999999,296.33851379999999,291.96900560000006,305.79662009999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Consider interpretive options",193.26820219999999,309.94780889999998,282.44014040000002,319.40591519999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Compare several translations",193.26820219999999,323.55710399999998,283.22635040000011,333.01521029999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Study the meaning of key words",193.26820219999999,337.16639909999998,291.36362389999999,346.62450539999998,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Consult commentaries",193.26820219999999,350.77569419999998,263.5082036,360.23380049999997,7.8621000000000008,false],["Steps to Discover",346.58670000000001,225.85280850000004,425.18631900000003,236.94997499999999,9.1035000000000004,false],["• \u0007 Create a textual outline",346.58670000000001,239.92641869999989,420.30174960000005,249.38452499999994,7.8621000000000008,false],["of your passage",353.01769999999999,249.36091869999984,398.21691290000001,258.8190249999999,7.8621000000000008,false],["• \u0007 Summarize the big idea",346.58650219999998,262.9